    "title": "About",
    "subtitle": "Learn more about this project",
    "projectTitle": "Open-source project",
    "project": "Castor is an open-source admin system built with Go, PostgreSQL, Redis, Next.js, and React. It brings user, role, resource, asset, notification, audit, and dictionary management into one workspace.",
    "interfaceTitle": "Administration",
    "interface": "Navigation and available actions reflect the permissions of your current session. The API checks access for each protected request.",
    "authTitle": "Authentication and authorization",
    "auth": "Castor supports password, email code, and SMS code login. Its RBAC3 authorization combines role inheritance, separation of duties, and session role activation.",
    "privacyTitle": "Data privacy",
    "privacy": "Information handled by Castor supports authentication, authorization, auditing, and the management workflows enabled in this deployment.",
